# Localized reel previews: the WebM and GIF regenerate from karafilt-reel.html
# in ~90s per language (marketing/tools/capture.js --lang=xx), and five of them
# would be ~30MB of derived binaries. The stills are kept - they are what goes
# into store listings and posts.
marketing/preview/*/karafilt-reel.webm
marketing/preview/*/reel.gif
